{"id":"765d36f5789b2740","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/549_解释性逻辑_IL.md","title":"549 解释性逻辑 IL","display":"549_解释性逻辑_IL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>否定与盒都不是原始构造子，而由解释性语言内部定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span> 是满足以下闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{549}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{549})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{549}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{549})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{int}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(\\operatorname{int}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{549}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{549}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{549}(A)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{549}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{549}(A)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,549}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,549}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{549}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{549})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{549}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{549})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{549}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{549}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{int}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{int}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{int}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{int}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{549}(\\sigma,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{549}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{549}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{549}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{549}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{549}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{549}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{549}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{549}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{549}\n=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{549}\n=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>解释性公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{549}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{549}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{549}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to((A\\lor B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{549}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to((A\\lor B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{549}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(\\Diamond A\\to\\Diamond B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{549}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(\\Diamond A\\to\\Diamond B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{549}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{549}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{549}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{549}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{549}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{549}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{549}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{549}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{549}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示形式、载体类型与总关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{549}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{549}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化只能作用于空依赖较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{549}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{549}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{549}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{549}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{549}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{549}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{549}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{549}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{549}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{549}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{549}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{549}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{549}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{549}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{549}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{549}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{549}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{549}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{549}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标特征是原始二元构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\triangleright B\">\\(A\\triangleright B\\)</span>，以及五个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 公理族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot\">\\(\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot\\)</span> 是派生式而非第五个原始构造子；因此公式、变元和替换递归均只需四个原始构造子子句。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{IL}_{549}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{549},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{549},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,549},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{549},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{549},\n\\vdash_{549},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{549}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{IL}_{549}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{549},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{549},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{549},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,549},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{549},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{549},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{549},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{549},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{549},\n\\vdash_{549},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{549}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含解释性模态句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含二元关系语义、算术解释或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{549}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\o